                <syllable xml:id="m-a80b8d82-e7e9-4118-aef2-213a9b6fd8c7">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-20d32cc8-f5fc-4119-8e5c-c6f673be260c" type="punctum" xml:id="m-49d5b49d-eaa5-48a2-8db3-6f725d96a46c">
                    <nc xml:id="m-4ab274d2-0ef2-40bd-8501-d23a7d4b7d05" pname="c" oct="4" tilt="se" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-1074fccc-36a1-486e-886d-d449748f4e53">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-de2a8cae-bb8c-46f9-a16b-0c818fc97088" type="virga" xml:id="m-7a76e439-b8fa-4cac-b0fd-5050e6813801">
                    <nc xml:id="m-986295b4-ee9f-4e93-9a85-da98b66a132b" pname="d" oct="4" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-7bc81497-5691-44a5-b1d6-6002fbbdfdf1">
              <lg xml:id="m-e4b26df2-d8e3-4ebb-9652-ce5d6354f78c">
                <l xml:id="m-5df7605e-d6ea-4ac3-ad6a-872fbe69a030" facs="#m-4aacb822-5f5f-4187-9eed-d3b13f17542b" label="ambiguous">232</l><l xml:id="m-5eb45795-dabd-43d2-974e-b3b614e5cdcf" facs="#m-61e50d7b-a1bc-49e6-9243-844e70e75c9d" label="text-like">sunday at Prime.</l><l xml:id="m-69f68747-d546-4ca3-89bb-0508c4446345" facs="#m-25b9acbe-281a-4d14-8537-2dce40ffba7d" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobíscum. R. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-b713956c-8b99-4597-9919-c2b052e2072a" facs="#m-b5b3b939-5190-487d-9eff-ca6005b4aeff" label="lyrics-like">V. Benedi-cámus Dómino. W. Dé-o grá-ti-as.</l><l xml:id="m-05a3ec4c-777e-4769-8871-06e530c751a4" facs="#m-c22680c2-8a39-41ec-b688-d7a0f5b15c37" label="text-like">The Martyrolosy is then read, at the end of which the Choir replies</l><l xml:id="m-02bbac4c-343d-4379-bbe2-f77fde90674d" facs="#m-295d1beb-5645-419f-8de5-e4e660474d24" label="lyrics-like">Déo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-31a86ddc-7b30-4a51-b748-c8c129d59bad" facs="#m-05474e48-aa20-4e5d-8b88-3b87ed0aa7f7" label="text-like">The Officiant next says:</l><l xml:id="m-75c9b397-46c4-4d98-98b2-93de971a2556" facs="#m-9561cdba-468f-4035-a7b0-348f0fe43a3f" label="lyrics-like">V. Pretiósa in conspéctu Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-ff1ce041-b9fe-4058-b76b-211f9819b5c8" facs="#m-86842e98-dd69-4c7a-b671-876d621b65dc" label="lyrics-like">K. Mors Sanctórumi éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-33450e23-04c8-47d5-9f1f-3f5a856643d1" facs="#m-5301ac11-68b0-4c32-89c9-81a7d924d658" label="lyrics-like">Then immediately, without saying Orémus. Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-a823fd9f-7889-4ed0-8083-e0c4c35f6a65" facs="#m-edcbd712-ee1c-43d0-852e-6b12c0ff9d18" label="lyrics-like">CAncta Maria et omnes Sancti intercédant pro nobis ad Dóminum,t</l><l xml:id="m-12bafe7f-480e-4383-b435-995721c5367d" facs="#m-84200e97-3efc-4ed2-bfc4-b751a6d6a1a7" label="lyrics-like">O ut nos mereámur ab eo adjuvári et salvári,* qui vivit et regnat</l><l xml:id="m-5038ef3d-7ca5-42d4-acba-f16ef73bfec1" facs="#m-05329e03-f215-44ea-a628-a6ac7e24d8cb" label="lyrics-like">in saécula saeculórum. B. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-845870c0-ee82-452e-9702-42aa2394246d" facs="#m-81275af2-6ad3-45a5-bb2f-c23951fff99c" label="lyrics-like">V. Déus in adjutórium méum inténde.</l><l xml:id="m-1355eddb-0717-4d1c-97a1-c755ecbb657d" facs="#m-f6dbd949-fbd3-4b61-a7ed-763302d732fb" label="lyrics-like">R. Dómine ad adjuvándum me festina.</l><l xml:id="m-298bfb24-92c7-497d-967d-c490139863fc" facs="#m-93e1bacb-b8c5-47c9-9caf-811ab40cdccd" label="text-like">This Versicle and its Response are said three times. Then:</l><l xml:id="m-5bbedca8-8fee-47af-9ce2-68a5dc115f9e" facs="#m-00b35de5-8f1b-4c9d-b9f3-27e5fc3bb3ff" label="lyrics-like">Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto. Sicut érat in principio, et</l><l xml:id="m-46c54a7c-1e93-4e90-8e57-dae017d69454" facs="#m-ac1b6c1f-6c8f-4adb-8bcb-670bb2a8b048" label="lyrics-like">nunc, et semper, * et in saécula sacculórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-0340e84c-265f-40f3-bf92-73fb312c4b10" facs="#m-4e6cdf9b-324f-4275-8f45-1196ce3e417a" label="lyrics-like">Kyrie eléison. Christe eléison. Kyrie eléison.</l><l xml:id="m-c5eb2c3a-2c32-440a-949f-488ee007ffdf" facs="#m-e825b03c-ef11-4076-88cb-8c44a3e5755c" label="lyrics-like">Páter nóster. cont. in sitence.</l><l xml:id="m-a6a685db-51c5-49b2-a4cf-836655bb9fa2" facs="#m-adf93e95-b442-4ee8-b8c6-077d2a9328e2" label="lyrics-like">V. Et ne nos indúcas in tentatiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-d7fa881b-1088-48ff-9ec8-020bb8f3aca3" facs="#m-e8d796b0-4df7-410c-a920-421c565b9da5" label="lyrics-like">R. Sed libera nos a málo.</l><l xml:id="m-925b3846-2c58-4162-9ea5-7856029a099e" facs="#m-12994a9c-b71e-4dfb-b097-05cfc606a11a" label="lyrics-like">V. Réspice in sérvos túos Dómine, et in ópera túa, et dirige filios</l><l xml:id="m-40659744-e51d-478f-a772-5dc382257887" facs="#m-bd24bb7b-aad3-42c8-9509-37def05bbc43" label="lyrics-like">eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-8f1c74eb-b73a-414c-a1e9-e689053147fd" facs="#m-acfe6e6a-7318-4160-aac9-543b2d7ce4f2" label="lyrics-like">K. Et sit spléndor Dómini Déi nóstri super nos, t et ópera mánuum</l><l xml:id="m-3b7e22f4-58f1-4dae-9124-d3dda1de513b" facs="#m-85b22cc7-dae0-44bb-99c6-62e52284e484" label="lyrics-like">nostrárum dirige super nos, * et ópus mánuum nostrárum dirige.</l><l xml:id="m-c018aefb-a66a-440f-9e3e-8eb1cde887b1" facs="#m-29e0cb30-0e0b-415e-a42a-8c9bc422649b" label="lyrics-like">V. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-cd0cc6a7-79b6-4170-afc6-dd02780270fc" facs="#m-3d06cb1a-0828-47ef-b31e-67975df8bfad" label="lyrics-like">K. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et semper, * et in saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b1d02b77-7dfa-4cc7-b0a9-c1c8caf81369" facs="#m-a57e36a8-cfda-4406-a646-2318a3928448" label="ambiguous">rum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-3b978064-89ee-44cf-acc1-d9c824df56a6" facs="#m-b6732313-c9a6-4cde-9793-0a7038ebba2b" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-b7e9dea4-b0b9-4698-abe9-fad6200efcd2" facs="#m-e4c88476-9c60-4640-8b35-352a16518be3" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-1bf81009-6f8c-4c6b-93ac-644231c5a281" facs="#m-4c6c1a2b-a8db-4f56-b0cf-0acb5992fe7e" label="lyrics-like">AIrígere et sanctificáre, régere et! tuórum :* ut hic, et in aetérnum,</l><l xml:id="m-562a3201-adb2-4081-ad7d-3f2a2b1bb09d" facs="#m-df8b8708-32c4-47c4-8e4c-62654fa94387" label="lyrics-like">te auxiliánte, salvi et liberi esse</l><l xml:id="m-e4c5198d-27bb-4eaa-8651-f0b61164a436" facs="#m-a9758dca-af4e-4b35-8335-36d563aaddc3" label="lyrics-like">U gubernáre dignáre, Dómine</l><l xml:id="m-78f8afc3-53c6-4ffc-805a-0d3861a5cd16" facs="#m-add1a6bf-7de5-4b2c-9cbf-2fbf925a069e" label="lyrics-like">mereámur, Salvátor mundi. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-44582f06-2c89-4ab8-8979-1732f3a211bf" facs="#m-0196c1f4-f427-4847-91ea-600334c2b6db" label="lyrics-like">Deus, Rex caeli et terrae, hódie</l><l xml:id="m-13b72eec-dd0b-4f25-be9f-3a089a6ce985" facs="#m-2cb8a5a4-c832-4bfa-a23c-01618e8c711f" label="lyrics-like">vivis et regnas in saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-20097240-8312-44c3-9cfe-0afc04859412" facs="#m-5101e0ae-0f14-458e-8536-036a65794131" label="lyrics-like">corda et córpora nostra, t sensus,</l><l xml:id="m-4b726850-082c-4b90-8cc4-59bfacb25344" facs="#m-1ca6d691-528a-4288-9992-8509b0ef154a" label="ambiguous">rum. B. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-83b2bbbe-90f8-4327-bd89-3c451d739488" facs="#m-98a69e2d-db6a-43d0-bcaf-21d75666681c" label="lyrics-like">sermónes et actus nostros in lege</l><l xml:id="m-ad0e44c6-0339-40a4-a1ae-50ba300888ab" facs="#m-e7acf600-2597-43d6-a57c-0e4c5d0da61f" label="lyrics-like">tua, et in opéribus mandatórum</l><l xml:id="m-a3a7e69b-7680-449e-9258-6546f66f67b8" facs="#m-fe8497ba-1d78-4524-bdb3-221e06b3624d" label="lyrics-like">V. Júbe dómne benedicere.</l><l xml:id="m-30ea7d6d-f4d6-4118-a394-defd6d8c812b" facs="#m-4f2e0f11-a70e-4b24-b7f6-ed56a5e8c3d9" label="lyrics-like">Blessing. Dies et áctus nóstros * in súa páce dispónat Dóminus omní¬</l><l xml:id="m-105c5add-1c5c-4adc-b4a5-358b868ee693" facs="#m-f8642c93-3fa1-44c4-a261-be6c3c5cd8f9" label="ambiguous">potens. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-5fdb06cd-2993-4208-9445-3694355a9229" facs="#m-6d3f72de-593a-4308-85c6-54c8c50a4d65" label="text-like">A Short Lesson is then read according to the Season or Feast as follows.</l><l xml:id="m-66094c52-bfe2-4062-8f7d-49e1bf27d076" facs="#m-ed88dcc8-d25e-4720-9245-a2b3f24cca41" label="text-like">From Jan. ¡ah to the rst Sunday ot Lent exclusive, and from Saturday</l><l xml:id="m-5bdf0337-9792-4b5b-8f81-c0fe5cb3169b" facs="#m-97b14ad1-10c0-4ca0-b54a-1026bff0cbd0" label="text-like">afier the Octave of the most Sacred Heart of Jesus to the Ist Sunday or</l><l xml:id="m-311a2992-41d3-40e4-8c62-79439fb9677f" facs="#m-4fd70981-21b8-455d-9a32-21ca5a8dcc2b" label="ambiguous">advent exclusive:</l><l xml:id="m-5e6bc0be-e583-403e-ada3-389284c0c9e9" facs="#m-5f0692bc-6ef0-4d94-a70f-ce9c53539e08" label="ambiguous">Short Lesson.</l><l xml:id="m-6b63f990-3127-4116-a679-4d0556a05b63" facs="#m-67714faf-3445-4e8c-94bf-e457545a0612" label="ambiguous">2. Thess. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-9995e14f-f451-4799-ac72-76c6865598b3" facs="#m-f619fb2b-88a4-4905-b04e-e91a5c9c2afa" label="lyrics-like">AOminus autem dirigat corda et et patiéntia Christi. Tu autem Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b3ebbc97-0a31-4acd-94b8-eef4ea6f7b14" facs="#m-d873732e-856d-4e28-b789-4fcf9fdfbd44" label="lyrics-like">U córpora nostra in caritáte Dei,»</l><l xml:id="m-13633382-be17-461e-a090-a64571148f0c" facs="#m-539f7390-a61d-4fa5-bef9-663b875868f5" label="lyrics-like">mine miserére nobis. B. Déográtias.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>